flowchart TD
  event{CI event}
  event -->|Main or full dispatch| full[Every test and release host]
  full --> release[Exact-head release-full gate]
  event -->|Ready PR| guard{Main or protected inputs?}
  guard -->|No| labels{Tier labels}
  guard -->|Yes or unavailable policy| allpr
  event -->|Draft PR| draft[Draft Linux tier]
  draft --> draftgate[Fan-ins fail: skipped draft]
  labels -->|Default| light[Linux plus CLI acceptance or Rust legs]
  light --> deferred[Name deferred macOS files]
  deferred --> prgate[Test fan-in includes compiler acceptance]
  labels -->|ci:mac or ci:e2e| tier[Selected opted-in tier]
  labels -->|ci:full| allpr[Full PR tiers]
  tier --> prgate
  allpr --> prgate
  event -->|Next push| before{Before push passed?}
  before -->|No or unknown| all[Full integration selection]
  before -->|Yes| select[Trusted selection from diff]
  all --> integration[Selected platform and Docker jobs]
  select --> integration
  integration --> gate[Integration fan-ins]
  class light,tier,allpr,integration,full live
  class deferred wait
  class draftgate fail
  class prgate,gate,release ok
